### Register User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Marouane ",
  "email": "marouane@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

###

### Login User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marouane@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

###

### Get Current User
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer 